  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13435781)\n“We were playing together, weren’t we? And we had fun.” Im Seoyu, a chaebol heiress raised like a delicate rose in a greenhouse, encounters a woman who looks just like her and receives a horrifying proposition. Seoyu decides to make her own offer: “I’ll pay you well. How about selling your life—just once?” Kang Munjo is a man who sleeps with women styled to look like Seoyu, so Seoyu becomes curious about just how rough and dangerous the relationship he offers might be. “From now on, our client’s name is Im Seoyu.” Amid encounters with more trash like Choi Beomgil, and Kang Munjo’s chilling warning—“If you know better, you shouldn’t stand at my eye level”—Seoyu finds herself in a thrilling, perilous relationship with a man who crushes women resembling the one he can never have. She revels in the danger, teetering on the edge of ruin.",
